# Both frontend/Dockerfile and admin/backend/Dockerfile now build with the
# repo root as context (they each need files from more than one top-level
# folder — see their own header comments) — this keeps that upload small
# and keeps secrets/build output out of every image's build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tanstack
**/src/generated
.git
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/*.log
